The '''Globulate Timecharm''' is a {{Special}} [[Rift Timecharms|Rift Timecharm]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A1 = Bacte Fragment |B1 = Bacte Fragment |C1 = Bacte Fragment
 |A2 = Bacte Fragment |B2 = Shy Crux, 20   |C2 = Bacte Fragment
