== Usage ==
The player can secure the '''Globulate Timecharm''' in the {{zone|Rift Gallery}} to gain {{SkyBlock XP|+100}} and unlock access to the {{zone|Barrier Street}} and {{zone|Photon Pathway}} and thus the {{zone|Stillgore Château}} and thus additionally the {{zone|Fairylosopher Tower}}.

=== Game Message ===
Securing the '''Globulate Timecharm''' will result in the following message, which will be broadcast to the entire lobby:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&d&lRIFTASTIC! &7[player] &ehas secured &cGlobulate Timecharm&e into their gallery! &6gg&e!}}}}
=== Rift Necklace ===
{{Main|Rift Necklace}}
Securing the '''Globulate Timecharm''' will add additional [[stats]] to the [[Rift Necklace]] both inside and outside the [[Rift Dimension]].

